  "type": "Catalog",
  "id": "carto-do",
  "stac_version": "1.1.0",
  "description": "Cloud-native (GeoParquet + PMTiles) mirror of public datasets from the CARTO Data Observatory: Spatial Features v4 for Spain, the United Kingdom and the United States on H3 resolution 8 and Quadgrid level 15, the Kontur Population and Global Fires grids, and the OpenCellID cell towers. Published by CARTO as a Portolan catalog: every collection is queryable directly from object storage with DuckDB and renders with the bundled MapLibre styles.",
